                                    <span>Leadership</span>
                                
                            </div>
                        
                        <div class="excerpt"><p><span style="color: #333333;">In this role you will be responsible for communicating with clients and cross functional teams to manage 3-7 projects (depending on project sizes) with concurrent workstreams. You will work with clients throughout project life cycles to plan resourcing that informs roadmaps, timelines, and recommendations, providing Free Range customers with a positive and consultative experience. You are a team leader who effectively harnesses the talents of others. You contribute to the creative process while efficiently moving toward final deliverables.</span></p></div>
                        <a class="hs-button" href="/jobs/project-success-manager">Apply to this job</a>
                        
