                                    <span>Iconography</span>
                                
                                    <span>Logos</span>
                                
                                    <span>Animation</span>
                                
                                    <span>Moodboards</span>
                                
                            </div>
                        
                        <div class="excerpt"><p>In this role you will be responsible for communicating with clients and cross-functional teams to understand the clients’ challenges and goals. You will work with clients throughout project life cycles to come up with creative moodboards, storyboards, caricatures, and other graphically designed elements that will help tell stories through infographics, iconography, animation, and video. Through your work, you will provide Free Range customers with a positive, creative, and consultative experience. You are a creative leader who effectively harnesses the talents of others and contributes to the creative process while efficiently moving toward final deliverables.</p></div>
                        <a class="hs-button" href="/jobs/graphic-motion-designer">Apply to this job</a>
                        
